    "title": "Bandit, 1 of 13 Sloth World rescued sloths, dies, zoo says - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ashley Carter Josh Frigerio Hannah Mackenzie Marie Edinger ,\n10 hours ago SANFORD, Fla. - Bandit, one of 13 Sloth World Orlando sloths rescued from a warehouse in Orlando and taken to the Central Florida Zoo, died Wednesday, the zoo announced. \"We are saddened to share that, despite our best efforts, Bandit, one of 13 sloths recently accepted into our care, passed today,\" the zoo said in a statement. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
